BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 317.77 Tm (Pace's own origin story is the first failure mode on the table. As a renovation contractor for Opendoor,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 302.55 Tm (Offerpad and Zillow, he financed a flipper's rehabs, putting up $100K and getting roughly $105K back at) Tj ET
