BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (the exact friction a hybrid is built to dissolve.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Every operator here opens the seller conversation the same way: find out what the money is actually for,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (then trade price for terms. Pace teaches to always start with cash, never with creative finance, and to ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (every seller why they haven't sold yet [pvgEqb4r4gw @ 00:02:35]; his Janie Munson lesson, find the) Tj ET
