BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (The second point of agreement is what actually wakes a lender up, and it is almost never the recorded deed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (itself. Morby says that most of the time the bank never notices, that even when it notices it does not care,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (and that the real triggers are transferring insurance incorrectly or stopping payments [cOTyo3LTDPk @) Tj ET
