BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 542.55 Tm (looked great: roughly $200,000 of property value, a $145,000 sale price, $30,000 down, 10 percent interest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 527.32 Tm (on a 30-year amortization. Then the promissory note turned out to be less than a page, and Nathan knew) Tj ET
