BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 481.65 Tm (00:20:04]. The servicing history showed the seller collecting principal, interest, taxes and insurance as one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 466.42 Tm (payment and keeping the escrow, which Nathan calls a big no-no because that is the borrower's money held) Tj ET
